    "detailed_description": "Space of another reality is an extendable virtual reality project that facilitates the students\u2019 exploration of virtual happenings, virtual events and virtual entrepreneurship through the current theoretical, industrial and technological frameworks at XJTLU\u2019s School of Cultural Technology<br />\r\nThe project is designed to create an allowance for an industrially engaged and project-based environment where students are encouraged to conceptualise, plan and execute a variety of content production that represent the current pioneering intersections of AR, VR, XR, imaging, moving image, virtual avatar and meta matters in a co-constructed virtual environment of interactivity",
